###############################################################################
# BLEAK - .gitignore for a Kerbal Space Program config mod
###############################################################################

## Release archives
# Built by zipping GameData for a release. Regenerated on demand, so there is
# no reason to carry them in history where they would bloat every clone.
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
Release/
Releases/
build/

## Game logs and runtime output, wherever they land
# TUFX's in-game editor also writes working copies of profiles to PluginData.
KSP.log
Player.log
output_log.txt
*.log
PluginData/

## IDE / editor cruft
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.sublime-workspace
*.bak
*~

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

###############################################################################
# Local-only working material. NOT for publication.
#
# Other mods' profiles and files, kept next to the repository to compare with.
# Other people's work under other people's terms; this mod ships none of it.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
###############################################################################
external-files/
NOTES.md
